1)Agentic AI is custom AI used for different domain like devops, HR, banking etc to do some tasks with out prompt, is that right?

Answer: Exactly !
        Agentic AI refers to AI systems that can take autonomous actions based on goals or triggers, rather than just responding to user prompts.

Example use cases:

DevOps: Automatically rebuilds or deploys code when a Git commit happens.

HR: Sends onboarding emails when a new employee record is added.

Banking: Detects fraud or rebalances portfolios automatically.

In short:

Agentic AI = AI that acts instead of only responds.



